# The web image's build context (WU-23b plan D1). BuildKit uses this file, beside
# apps/web-nextjs/Dockerfile, in place of the root .dockerignore (which stays the API image's).
# An allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what the web build needs is added back. The
# cassettes and the backend's sources never enter this context.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
# Manifests only, so the frozen install sees the whole workspace.
!backends/api-nextjs/package.json
!tests/contract/package.json
!tests/journeys/package.json
!packages/domain-schema/
!spec/messages/
!apps/web-nextjs/

# Never, even inside an allowed directory.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-journeys
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.env*
apps/web-nextjs/tests
apps/web-nextjs/Dockerfile*
